# Blasted Lands - Recipes & Patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes and patterns whose SOURCE is physically in the Blasted Lands,
# verified against the local Forever game data (questie-forever item vendor
# and drop tables). One recipe is vendor-sold by the in-zone Alliance-safe
# vendor Nina Lightbrew at Nethergarde; one pattern drops each from two
# named in-zone mobs that spawn nowhere else, so it is genuinely zone
# content. Everything else Blasted-Lands-dropping is a generic multi-zone
# world drop (Elwynn rule, argued per case in the inventory - including the
# Lord Kazzak-table plans, which span up to 32 zones), and quest records
# carry no reward data, so neither ships (see
# docs/blasted-lands-companions-inventory.md and
# docs/companion-unverified.md). Trainer-taught staples are excluded:
# Polestar's own profession guides cover those. Each step is gated to its
# profession; other characters skip it cleanly. Blacksmithing, Cooking,
# Enchanting, Engineering, First Aid, Fishing and Tailoring have no
# Blasted Lands source, so that is stated, not padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/blasted-lands-recipes
title Blasted Lands - Recipes & Patterns
levels 40-50
zone Blasted Lands
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords blasted lands, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Nethergarde vendor - Nina's stock (Alchemy)

  zone map 1419

  when skill Alchemy 1

  tip Nina Lightbrew (66.87, 18.24), Alchemy Supplies, sells the recipe at Nethergarde.
  buy 9300 "Recipe: Elixir of Demonslaying"
  note Stock class is unconfirmed in the data (no limited flag either way).

step North-west and center hunters - heavy scorpid vest (Leatherworking)

  zone map 1419

  when skill Leatherworking 1

  loop
  goto 44.31,33.60
  goto 62.59,40.81
  kill 5981 optional
  kill 6005 optional
  collect 15727 "Pattern: Heavy Scorpid Vest" optional
  note The Portal Seeker (north-west) and the Shadowsworn Thug (center) are the sole droppers anywhere in the data, and both spawn only in the Blasted Lands. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.

step No Blasted Lands source - Blacksmithing
  note Blacksmithing has no recipe source physically in the Blasted Lands in the data - no vendor sells them here and no in-zone mob drops them - so this guide carries nothing for it. Polestar's own profession guides cover trainer-taught staples.

